# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data , NOTHING under data/ is shared at this time.
#
# Per the Dutch coauthors' institutional requirement, NO corpus data is released
# (not even the dehydrated id+label file) until the university privacy officer
# (FG/DPO) and research-ethics committee approve. The dehydration + rehydration
# machinery (toxicity_criterion/labelling/build_dehydrated.py and rehydrate.py)
# is in place so the data can be published on approval by un-ignoring the
# relevant paths below. See data/README.md and DATA_RELEASE.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/derived/
data/public/

# Belt-and-braces: never commit corpus/label artifacts wherever staged.
data/**/*.jsonl
data/**/*.csv
data/**/*_dataset.jsonl

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Committed on purpose (no personal data):
#   data/README.md
#   results/*.json   (aggregate result tables)
#   figures/*.pdf , figures/*.mmd   (anonymized / synthetic)
#
# On ethics approval, release by un-ignoring (in order of increasing exposure):
#   data/public/validation/panel_*.csv + validation_populations.json   (PII-free)
#   data/public/corpus_dehydrated.csv                                  (dehydrated)
#   (full hydrated set: by gated/dedicated access, not committed here)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
